WEBVTT

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:05.400
The First Phoinike War came to an end.

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:10.150
Adding to their existing vassal state,
the Tharros Kingdom,

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:14.530
the Balt-Rhein Empire gained control of
another key location in The Centro trade route.

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:19.330
In recognition of the Duchess Lelederik of Ellvaldes'
integral part in the mission's success,

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:26.710
the emperor promised her half of the tax revenue
collected on the new territory as long as she lived.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.760
The fall of Phoinike not only rocked
The Centro nations,

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.090
it sent shockwaves throughout all of Rumeriana.

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:36.260
Each nation sensing danger

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:40.270
took action to prioritize their own survival.

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:46.270
Birlik Torqye is a federation comprised of
the Torqye Pashalu and four satellite nations.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.770
Thirteen days after the fall of Phoinike,

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:53.150
the sultans of each nation gathered in Altu

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:55.700
to attend the Birlik Torqye Divan.

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:58.410
The council was called together to vote on

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:03.200
the adoption of the Birlik Torqye federation,
a motion first proposed by the Torqye Pashalu

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:06.710
in response to the Empire's
growing hegemony 12 years ago.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:17.180
Sultan of Muzrak Sultanlu
Balaban

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:22.100
Sultan of Kuluch Sultanlu
Selim

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:26.810
Sultan of Bechke Stratocracy
Uzun

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:31.020
Sultan of Balta Sultanlu
Fatma

00:01:32.230 --> 00:01:33.570
Tally the votes.

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:49.790
All four nations oppose.

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:54.960
This is the first I've ever
seen a Torqyean proposal rejected.

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:08.270
Were they afraid to take a hostile position
against the Empire?

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:11.190
If that is the case, there is no saving them.

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:13.400
Our current system has run its course.

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:15.570
We should simply annex the four countries

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:18.070
and form a Torqyean union.

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:21.410
I see upstarts do not know their place.

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:25.830
The four houses leading the four stratocracies
are the elite of the elite.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.250
Tesisat-Kapı Sarucha Pasha.

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:30.120
Perhaps this is their way of expressing
their objection

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:32.790
to the inequality of rights they were given.

00:02:35.380 --> 00:02:36.670
Zaganos Pasha.

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:39.380
It would be best not to get any ideas.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:43.970
If something were to happen to them,
things will not end quietly.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.980
When every second is precious,

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:54.440
they waste our time with this nonsense.

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:15.420
Altair: A Record of Battles

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:27.910
Muzrak Sultanlu
Liman

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:33.540
Everyone here is dressed like Mahmut Bey.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:36.920
Yes, this is already within Birlik Torqye's
cultural sphere.

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:40.710
We'll continue our way through the
Muzrak Sultanlu and enter Regatul Urado.

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:45.970
The Empire's hands have not yet reached
these coastal nations, from what I've seen.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:50.770
Regatul Urado is the last one on my list,
and I'd like to see its current condition myself.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.780
Padrone, I have some bad news.

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.740
He is a weapons dealer.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.820
That's certainly dangerous.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:10.120
The Red Tiger Sultan

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:13.120
Liman
Water Shrine

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.460
It's completely closed off.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:18.920
There are over 500 people inside.

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:22.880
They are all armed with swords.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:36.350
What are you doing here?

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:41.770
I just came from The Centro to offer my prayers,
but I couldn't get inside.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.570
I am Tughril Mahmut.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:49.950
Binbashu of the Torqye Pashalu.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:51.370
Stand down, men.

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:53.370
Sheath your swords.

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:03.340
Please, forgive them, Mahmut Bey.

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.970
I am aware of who you are.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:07.680
I am Silahtar Beyazit.

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:08.890
Beyolu Silahtar Beyazit

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:12.720
I am the younger brother
of Muzrak Sultanlu's Sultan Balaban.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:15.060
That makes me Beyolu.

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:18.020
This is the daughter of the Balta Sultanlu's sultan,

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:19.690
Prenses Aishe.

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:21.190
Prenses Armut Aishe

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:26.610
I am also the kulak stationed at this city.

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:29.240
The brother of a sultan?

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:32.530
Nice to meet you. I'm Kiros, kulak of Phoinike.

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:37.410
This lanky one here is a former Venedician
mercenary captain, Abiriga.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.000
Pleased to meet you.

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:40.670
From Venedik?

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:42.590
Tughril Mahmut.

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:44.210
I have heard the rumors.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:47.590
The inexperienced child pasha
who abandoned his military duties

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:50.130
to help his friend all on his own.

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:52.140
Indeed I am.

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:56.060
Please, excuse her, Mahmut Bey.

00:06:56.220 --> 00:06:59.140
The Prenses only knows you through rumors.

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:03.020
No, your perception is accurate.

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:04.440
More importantly,

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:07.150
what exactly is going on here?

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.780
Yes, of course.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:11.990
I am not sure where to begin.

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:19.000
The four stratocracies have rejected federalization?

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:21.710
Why would they do that?

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:25.920
I have expressed my opinions at length
to my brother, but...

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:29.220
Where do Sultan Balaban's intentions lie?

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:33.510
If there is any way I could meet him,
I would like to ask him directly.

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:35.140
My brother is dangerous.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:37.220
It is best you did not meet.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:40.350
There are paths that open through dialogue.

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:43.900
I've continued to act on that belief.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:47.400
That path feels horribly roundabout to me.

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:50.400
I am hoping that is not the case.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:52.860
I cannot stop you, can I?

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:59.410
My brother is currently en route.
He should arrive here in Liman soon.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:02.710
I look forward to hearing what you were able to learn

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:06.790
the next time we meet again.

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:16.350
So that is the famous Yenicheri.

00:08:16.550 --> 00:08:20.430
The elite squad of soldiers
who have sworn fealty to the sultan.

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:23.480
I see just how many soldiers monarchies will deploy

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:26.060
for a simple domestic inspection tour.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:29.070
No, this is far too many.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:30.360
Ten thousand men?

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:36.370
As expected of my brother.
He gathered so many on such short notice.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:39.040
My brother will likely head here directly

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.540
after his meeting with Mahmut Bey.

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.500
As I've ordered,

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:46.170
all units, please, begin making preparations.

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:49.090
I am sorry, Uncle.

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.050
This is all because of me.

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.470
Prenses Aishe.

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:57.220
This was bound to happen with my brother
sooner or later.

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:00.100
It is nothing you should feel responsible for.

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:02.890
The Muzrak Sultanlu is a monarchy.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:06.650
A nation where all can be decided
on the sultan's whim.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:09.900
If I should offend the sultan,

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:12.530
there is no telling what might happen.

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:21.950
I would first like to thank you
for granting me this audience.

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:25.540
You are quite the attractive one, Mahmut Bey.

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:31.050
If you were not a Torqyean soldier already,
I would have liked you in my Yenicheri.

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:33.550
-You honor me, Your Highness.
-So?

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:37.050
Do you want to ask me
about the Birlik Torqye Divan?

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:40.680
Yes, the Birlik Torqye federation was created

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:47.520
to fend off foreign enemies in times of emergency
with Torqye at the center, coordinating the other nations.

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:50.480
Why would you abandon it now?

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:54.110
There is no question that
the Balt-Rhein Empire will invade us.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:56.320
Without Birlik Torqye,

00:09:56.490 --> 00:09:59.450
I cannot imagine Torqye nor Muzrak surviving.

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:01.580
If that is what you believe,

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:06.870
then Torqye should request the cooperation
of each nation with the proper respect.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.080
When you do, Muzrak shall reconsider our position.

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:14.590
Muzrak is a nation, and I am its sultan.

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:19.340
The Torqye Pashalu has no right ordering us around.

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:25.220
Are you looking to incite civil war?

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:27.730
If Muzrak and Torqye go to war,

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:30.730
then that is a military conflict
between two separate nations.

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:33.440
Isn't that the case, Mahmut Bey?

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:36.360
Don't worry.

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:39.950
It will not be civil war. It will be suppression.

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:42.660
My younger brother Beyazit defied my decision,

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:45.660
and barricaded himself inside the water shrine.

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:49.620
I cannot ignore such insurrection.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:54.130
I have a question for you as well.

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:56.800
Torqye demoted you,

00:10:56.960 --> 00:11:00.800
even though you were the one
who accomplished the most in Hisar.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:06.140
Do you believe their decision was justified?

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:10.020
If it were me, I would care
about the results, not the means.

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:16.440
I do not jest when I ask if you
would consider joining my Yenicheri.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:20.490
Individuals with talent left to waste on the sidelines.

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:25.370
Have you never feared that this situation
would continue indefinitely?

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:27.750
You've never harbored any doubt towards Torqye?

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:29.830
I lashed out at first.

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:36.630
But eventually I was able to see my conceited
and inexperienced actions for what they were.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:41.260
I respect and love my homeland
for rightfully acknowledging those with talent,

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:43.680
while punishing those who have done wrong.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:47.100
When I deserve to become Pasha once again,

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:49.270
I hope to be of use to Torqye.

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:53.770
It seems that we love different things.

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:59.440
I do not believe Torqye's decisions are always right.

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.990
I don't want to get dragged down with them

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:04.870
when Torqye decides to go down the wrong path.

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:08.120
Is that the consensus in Muzrak?

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:11.120
Whether it's the consensus is not the issue.

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:13.620
I will cut down all who defy me.

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:17.250
Even your own brother?

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.010
I have given him plenty of time,

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:23.880
and all he's done is run away
after making his insurrection known.

00:12:24.050 --> 00:12:26.850
I am ashamed to have such a coward for a brother.

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.850
Beyazit.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:36.110
This is your last warning.

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:41.360
All will be forgiven if you immediately hand over
the traitor Prenses Aishe of the Balta Sultanlu.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:45.860
If not, I will burn down this water shrine,
along with the rest of you.

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:48.580
Prenses Aishe, a traitor?

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:51.830
Balta's sultan is my younger sister Fatma.

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:53.460
Aishe is her daughter.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:13:00.170
Discontent with the four sultans of the stratocracies
for opposing the Birlik Torqye federation,

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:03.170
she staged a failed coup in Balta,

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:07.680
before running to Beyazit,
who she's idolized since she was young.

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:10.100
I hope she's able to get away.

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:13.680
Sultan, they are not making any motions to leave.

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:25.740
This is the only path.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:30.240
When I give the signal, begin descending
down this drain one by one.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:33.450
Prenses, if you hold your breath for a minute,

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:35.620
you can make it to Liman's ford.

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:37.120
You can do that, can't you?

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:40.380
Yes. I have practiced holding my breath.

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:43.090
Mahmut Bey.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.670
I hope you've learned

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:49.300
just how dangerous my brother Balaban is.

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:52.100
Burn everything to the ground.

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:54.680
Mahmut Bey.

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:59.270
Unfortunately, we are unable to properly
entertain our honored guests here.

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:02.440
Allow us to show you to my palace.

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:07.490
It seems that it would be best
not to turn down your invitation.

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.570
A wise decision.

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:12.410
I will not make you regret it.

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:18.120
News of Muzrak's Beyolu Beyazit's rebellion
and its suppression

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:21.540
reached the Torqye Pashalu.

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:23.380
Mahmut.

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:26.170
You've just got the worst luck.

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:31.470
Beyazit is loyal to Torqye,
enough to become my kulak.

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:35.020
I had hoped he would remain in a safe position.

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:36.810
However...

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:41.770
Buyuk Pasha, we should take this as good news.

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:45.320
Even Balaban's Muzrak Sultanlu is in disarray.

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:50.740
It would not be strange to imagine that there are others
who feel discontent with their sultans as well.

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:53.780
What if we rallied such individuals,

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:55.990
and, with our aid,

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:59.420
lead them to overthrow the four stratocracies
from within.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:01.080
Oh, how terrifying.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:05.000
Take down by force those who don't do as you say.

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:07.760
That is a tactic of fools.

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:12.890
We've economically pressured
the four stratocracies for the last month.

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:19.690
Yet they continue to insist they will not negotiate
unless they are given equal rights with Torqye.

00:15:19.890 --> 00:15:22.600
We do not have time for these games.

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:28.280
I think there is a rather simple solution
to ending this stalemate.

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:31.360
I believe now is the time we meet their demands,

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:34.700
and create a new structure
in which all five nations are equal.

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:36.740
Just try and do that,

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:39.290
and Birlik Torqye would immediately collapse.

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:41.500
How could he say that?

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:42.880
Zaganos Pasha.

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.670
Please, calm down.

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:46.710
They are not fools.

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:50.550
Once they realize that we should be
cooperating with each other--

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:52.680
If they think we should cooperate,

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:55.010
then why are they not cooperating with us now?

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:56.180
That's because--

00:15:56.350 --> 00:16:00.020
Because they thought they'd try to
take this opportunity to become our equal?

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:02.350
That we would break first?

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:05.020
Is that what they gambled on?

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:08.650
Any decent nation would not make
a gamble they have no chance of winning.

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:10.030
And they have.

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:12.030
They believe they can survive,

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:16.200
even if they sever ties with Torqye,
even when they're economically pressured.

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:20.870
They could only do that if they
had a major world power behind them.

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:24.370
Buyuk Pasha.

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:28.500
Regarding my earlier proposal of staging coups
in the four stratocracies,

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:32.300
you have my guarantee of its success.

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:37.510
I, Zehir Zaganos, would like you
to entrust this matter to me.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:42.100
Are you sure you want to do this with Mahmut?

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:46.400
I never thought you'd entrust him
with something this important.

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:49.400
The reason I am using Mahmut Bey for this matter

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:51.740
is for insurance.

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:57.490
If, on the off chance, the military coup
is discovered to be Torqye's doing,

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:01.500
we can say that it was all organized
by a lone, overzealous soldier,

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:06.330
and throw him to the wolves.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:11.960
I was hoping we could do this in a different way,

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:15.010
but I guess failure is not an option here.

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:17.970
All right, time to overthrow a country.

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:28.560
To think you would be so impressed by the fountain.

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:30.110
Yes, sultan.

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:34.570
I have never seen such an ingenious
mechanism in my life.

00:17:35.110 --> 00:17:37.030
Just how does it work?

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:42.660
This handle here adjusts the water pressure
coming from the aqueduct.

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:45.830
That's amazing.

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:49.080
I understand that you
enjoy writing poems, Mahmut Bey.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:50.250
Yes.

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:53.510
I will introduce you to a poetry reading next week.

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:56.130
Thank you, I look forward to it.

00:17:56.930 --> 00:17:58.890
Man, I'm full.

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:03.810
Tonight's a new moon. How about we turn in early?

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:08.400
That was skillfully done.

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:10.980
They aren't dead, are they?

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:14.230
No. I pulled back quite a bit.

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:17.950
Let's proceed quickly and quietly.

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:20.950
What exactly are you doing?

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:23.910
Oh, if it isn't Hanum Eleanor.

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:26.790
Inviting Mahmut Bey to your palace.

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:32.630
It is better than giving him the freedom
to sniff around my territory.

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:36.590
It isn't that you simply enjoy the company
of a boy like him?

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:39.260
I'll never make sense of it.

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:43.010
How can you base the members of your
elite squad around their attractiveness?

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:47.180
Hanum Eleanor, nothing is more important
than a beautiful face.

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:53.730
The sultan doesn't understand.

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:58.820
If you don't kill that boy when you have the chance,
you'll live to regret it.

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:04.700
In all palaces within Birlik Torqye, there will
always be a sewer running near the north gate.

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:07.660
We can escape if we make it there.

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:15.500
What is so funny, Hanum Eleanor?

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:16.670
Nothing.

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:20.550
I hate those who try to sneak away.

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:29.730
That's a signal to the Yenicheri.

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:33.060
If we want to do this peacefully,
maybe we should just talk to them.

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:36.270
Well, I never thought this was going to go smoothly.

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.530
It's our job to put ourselves on the line.

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:39.860
Right, Mr. Lanky?

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:43.240
If worst comes to worst, I can take around 50 men.

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:47.450
Yes, but let's make sure it doesn't come to that.

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:49.960
Now then,

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:51.960
let's begin.

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:57.460
It seems there are some imposters
among my precious Yenicheri.

00:19:57.670 --> 00:20:03.470
And so, I will have all of you
show me your faces one by one.

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:17.690
It was unwise of you to try
to disguise yourselves as my Yenicheri.

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:19.650
Imposter.

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:24.450
Do you know why the Yenicheri's
face must be beautiful?

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:27.530
It is because the majority of my nation's people

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:32.790
live most of their lives without even
the chance to speak with me or my Yenicheri.

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:38.250
The people only know their rulers
from seeing us in passing.

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:40.050
Such poor taste.

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:44.380
Then should we not at least ensure our faces

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:49.390
are worthy of adoration, Mahmut Bey?

00:20:51.600 --> 00:20:53.730
You disappoint me.

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:59.520
If you wished to leave my palace,
you could have done so more elegantly.

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:03.860
I despise people who aren't open and honest.

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:08.070
I can't forgive those who only
run around like cowards.

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:10.830
You will now die, just like my younger brother.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:15.830
I will burn this pretty face of yours to a crisp.

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:22.050
Amazing. I never thought this would work so well.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:26.220
Do not panic.

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:31.560
I can see everything clearly.

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:33.890
Captains, get the torches relit.

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:51.120
Just how many did
that lanky bastard take down quietly?

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:56.790
This changes nothing.

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:59.000
I will not let you escape.

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:03.380
We're almost there, Kiros.

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:10.390
See?

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:13.470
This is why the sultan was too soft.

00:22:14.640 --> 00:22:16.810
Rod Orm.

00:23:48.650 --> 00:23:51.450
To think the shadow of the Empire reached this far.

00:23:51.610 --> 00:23:53.030
We have no time to waste.

00:23:53.200 --> 00:23:54.700
First we need to find allies.

00:23:55.580 --> 00:23:57.540
Next time, "Dance of the Moonlit Beauty."

00:23:58.330 --> 00:24:00.830
Let us gather stars during this dark night.
